---
import AnimatedLink from "../components/AnimatedLink.astro";
import BodyText from "../components/BodyText.astro";
import Greetings from "../components/Greetings.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Logo from "../components/Logo.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Separator from "../components/Separator.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Header>
    <Logo />
    <Nav />
    <Greetings greeting="Work" />
  </Header>
  <main class="page-content">
    <p>
      Alternatively you can download a more classical pdf resume <AnimatedLink
        href="/Resume_Guillaume_Técher.pdf">here</AnimatedLink
      >.
    </p>
    <section>
      <h3>Radio-canada</h3>

      <h4>Public Space Incubator:</h4>
      <BodyText>
        A startup-like team where we developed conversational spaces that
        promote engagement and healthy dialogue. In collaboration with <AnimatedLink
          href="https://newpublic.org/">New_Public</AnimatedLink
        > and other public broadcasters. I was in charge of multiple core features
        (admin view, special layouts, and more), migrations, and helped guide the
        work on accessibility. We nearly doubled the number of interactions (comments,
        reactions) on our platform compared to the industry average.
      </BodyText>
      <h4>Digital production studio:</h4>
      <BodyText>
        My team was responsible for a portfolio of about 10 projects. I grew to
        be the reference person for 3 of them, including <AnimatedLink
          href="https://ici.radio-canada.ca">Radio-Canada</AnimatedLink
        >'s homepage. My work includes 3 major migrations of technological
        stacks, resulting in improved stability and easier onboarding. I
        improved the internal library by simplifying its routing layer, reducing
        its size by 20%. Most of my work has been on components and pages that
        reached millions of people.
      </BodyText>
      <Separator text="2023" />
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Dialogue</h3>
      <h4>Care provider experience</h4>
      <BodyText>
        I automated repetitive tasks for doctors and nurses, eliminating
        redundant steps. As a result, 15% of finished consultations were
        automatically processed. Seamlessly migrated care plans between two
        APIs, centralizing them in a single web app, which greatly improved the
        user experience.
      </BodyText>

      <h4>Botfront at Dialogue</h4>
      <BodyText>
        Dialogue, a telemedicine company, acquired Botfront in 2021. We
        successfully integrated Botfront into Dialogue’s tech stack, improving
        how chatbots are visualized and empowering medical staff to edit them
        directly. The import-export system I had built became a cornerstone of
        this work.
      </BodyText>
      <Separator text="2021" />
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Botfront</h3>
      <h4>Botfront</h4>
      <BodyText>
        6-person startup where we built a SaaS tool to create chatbots. I
        architected and built core features of the application (frontend,
        backend, infrastructure). I built an import-export system with error
        detection, which allowed us to integrate with Git and to version the
        chatbots. I created an analytics system providing actionable insights to
        our clients (BNC, Accor, Orange, and 40 others). I added on-screen
        guidance capabilities driven by the conversation, which allowed
        replacing messages with live highlighting. Acquired by Dialogue.
      </BodyText>

      <Separator text="2019" />
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>ESEO</h3>
      <h4>Master of Software Engineering :</h4>
      <BodyText>
        2 years of Mathematics, Physics and Electronics (Classe préparatoire)
        and then 3 years of software engineering. Last year project: Metro
        network simulator, simulating millions of trips.
      </BodyText>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  h4 {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  main {
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  p {
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  section {
    width: 70%;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    section {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    p {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
